{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27245","headline":"答友人惠牙簪 · 章孝标","name":"答友人惠牙簪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牙簪不可忘，来处隔炎荒。\n截得半环月，磨成四寸霜。\n晓辞梳齿腻，秋入发根凉。\n好是纱巾下，纤纤锥出囊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}